# the private local-setup file (holds tokens/creds) must never be committed
intent-aware-LOCAL-SETUP.md

# Claude Code config dir — LOCAL ONLY, never committed. If anyone follows the
# CLAUDE.md recipe and runs `CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR=$(pwd)/.claude claude setup-token`,
# this fills with the OAuth token AND session transcripts (projects/*.jsonl,
# history.jsonl, shell-snapshots/) that routinely contain pasted secrets.
# settings.json is ignored too: it records this machine's enabled plugins, which
# is a per-developer choice, not a project dependency.
.claude/
